WEBVTT

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:19.950
You did well, Hokaze Kon.

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:24.120
Because of your hard work, 
we've completed the first ritual!

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.440
That's wonderful.

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:27.520
One question, though.

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:28.460
Yes?

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:31.710
These are marriage rituals, correct?

00:00:32.020 --> 00:00:32.790
That's right.

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:35.970
And you're the one getting 
married, is that right?

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:37.170
That's right.

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:40.220
So, I'm not involved, right?

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:41.510
That's right.

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:45.100
Then why the hell do 
I have to do this?!

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:48.700
Do it yourself!

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:51.050
That is not something you 
make someone else do!

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:52.930
Why did I have to go down the river,

00:00:52.930 --> 00:00:55.660
swallow all that water, 
and almost drown for you?!

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:59.700
Oh me, oh my, it looks like he's 
really cheesed off, poor fellow!

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:01.520
You're guilty, too!

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:04.540
It seems you are not aware 
of what a ritual entails.

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:09.440
This is a ritual, and rituals are tradition.

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:07.340
Yeah.

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:10.050
Right.

00:01:10.050 --> 00:01:12.840
Tradition means conventions and practices,

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:15.280
which means no matter how 
unreasonable or absurd they may seem,

00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:18.160
they need to be performed to the letter.

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:19.680
And if you were to ask me why, well,

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:22.600
the answer is that it's a ritual.

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:25.580
That is not an explanation!

00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:03.340
And thus, the marriage rituals 
are proceeding wonderfully.

00:03:03.340 --> 00:03:05.040
Right now, I am in the 
process of performing

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:06.830
a falling dominoes ritual.

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:09.780
This long, long winding road is a

00:03:09.780 --> 00:03:13.010
physical representation 
of marriage itself.

00:03:13.770 --> 00:03:16.900
Speaking of, what was the ritual 
that came after ritual number one?

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:23.340
That log passed the first ritual beautifully.

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:27.810
Now, you will carve swans 
to represent eternal love.

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:29.130
Swans?

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:33.350
Yes. Two swans swearing 
eternal love to each other.

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:38.630
What eternal love?!

00:03:38.630 --> 00:03:40.040
Can you eat that?!

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:40.860
I don't give a damn!

00:03:41.140 --> 00:03:43.200
Giving a damn is part of the ritual.

00:03:44.020 --> 00:03:45.970
Then here I go!

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:56.040
Yeah? Not bad, huh?

00:03:56.460 --> 00:04:00.060
You have now completed the second ritual.

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:01.900
Good job.

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:03.740
Next...

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:05.910
What, next? That's enough!

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:07.810
Just get married already!

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:10.110
That's not possible.

00:04:10.530 --> 00:04:13.150
Stopping the marriage rituals halfway...

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:14.980
...would mean your death.

00:04:15.390 --> 00:04:16.280
Just a second!

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:19.110
It's not even my wedding, 
so why do I gotta risk my life?

00:04:19.510 --> 00:04:20.710
Because that's the ritual.

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:22.820
Not that again, I heard that already!

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:24.700
C'mon Princess! Do something!

00:04:26.210 --> 00:04:27.300
Just leave it to me.

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:29.270
I'll get involved in the ritual, too.

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:43.760
Why are we folk dancing?

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:46.690
Our love must burn like a flame!

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:48.140
Oh, please!

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:53.230
The same song keeps spinning 
around and around in my head!

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:55.940
Someone! Help!

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:57.980
That was a good fire.

00:04:58.570 --> 00:04:59.910
It made some nice ash.

00:05:01.020 --> 00:05:03.690
Now you will use that 
ash to draw this here.

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:06.590
What kind of religion is this?!

00:05:07.730 --> 00:05:10.240
It's not a religion. It's a ritual.

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:13.410
Love is something you build up 
diligently, little by little.

00:05:14.270 --> 00:05:16.960
Those old timers knew what 
they were talking about.

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:18.330
I seriously don't care!

00:05:21.410 --> 00:05:23.080
Good job, Kon.

00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:25.180
I... I get it now.

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:28.350
A little grain of ash is the universe,

00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:30.800
and the universe is nothing 
more than a grain of ash.

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:34.720
Macro comes from micro, 
and life has no end.

00:05:35.030 --> 00:05:37.810
The truth is always with us.

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:40.410
Wha?

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:42.420
You're blowing away the truth!

00:05:42.420 --> 00:05:44.640
Love is also something quite ephemeral.

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:47.290
Do I look like I care?!

00:05:49.140 --> 00:05:49.940
Right.

00:05:49.940 --> 00:05:52.940
That was the digest of 
the events up until now.

00:05:53.320 --> 00:05:59.540
Right now, I, Hokaze Kon, am in 
the middle of performing the fifth ritual.

00:06:43.110 --> 00:06:44.350
This is so annoying!

00:06:45.390 --> 00:06:48.760
I keep putting these little things up, 
again and again and again.

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:50.640
It's like, how long do I 
have to keep doing this?!

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:53.580
That's 4,503,279 pieces.

00:06:54.340 --> 00:06:56.280
4,500,000 pieces?

00:06:57.220 --> 00:07:03.730
4,503,278 dominoes were felled for the 
previous Lord Jugglaburk's wedding.

00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:06.230
Which is why this wedding must

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:08.530
exceed that number by at least one.

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:11.110
4,500,000 pieces, you know...

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:11.950
That's right.

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:14.770
It's a preposterous number, 
but that is the ritual.

00:07:15.420 --> 00:07:18.620
It is the holy ritual that must 
not be sullied in any way!

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:20.430
4,500,000.

00:07:20.430 --> 00:07:23.100
Is that the number of sweet nothings 
he will whisper in my ear?

00:07:23.100 --> 00:07:25.630
Or the sound of thundering jeers?

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:30.180
One man is born, one woman 
lives, they meet and mingle...

00:07:30.180 --> 00:07:32.830
The come together, and in that time,

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:34.640
how many words flow between them?

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:36.750
Hello?

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:37.890
You're not acting like yourself.

00:07:38.570 --> 00:07:41.730
Maybe I'm a little bit jealous.

00:07:42.070 --> 00:07:44.190
You're jealous? Why?

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:45.640
Marriage.

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:51.510
A word that will never 
be written in my journal.

00:07:51.510 --> 00:07:52.490
That word, marriage.

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:55.680
I'm a tiny bit jealous of the princess.

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:59.040
Not that I can tell that to anyone.

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:01.360
That's funny, 'cause you're 
totally telling me.

00:08:01.360 --> 00:08:03.120
I'm totally hearing it.

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:05.250
Isn't it strange?

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:08.920
I still have the urge 
inside me to love someone.

00:08:09.450 --> 00:08:11.840
Men, women, I turn everyone's head.

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:15.050
I'm beautiful, I'm intelligent, 
and I can work hard.

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:18.310
My popular phase is never ending!

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:20.430
That is me, Mariandel!

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:21.740
And yet!

00:08:22.130 --> 00:08:23.460
Sometimes it crosses through my chest...

00:08:23.460 --> 00:08:24.940
I don't want to just receive!

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:26.790
I want to love! Passionately!

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:28.570
Earnestly! Someone!

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:31.180
Someone!

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:33.660
Excuse me.

00:08:33.660 --> 00:08:34.990
I'm full.

00:08:35.520 --> 00:08:36.560
You're right.

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:39.000
It's an adult's fairy tale.

00:08:39.610 --> 00:08:40.660
Just forget it.

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:44.330
Just stop!

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:47.860
I have no intention of 
understanding your feelings.

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:51.020
No! I will follow you, even in death!

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:52.890
You're an idiot.

00:08:52.890 --> 00:08:53.670
Do as you will.

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:56.130
Honey!

00:08:56.650 --> 00:09:00.580
Will you knock off this idiotic 
lovers' quarrel dubbing?

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:03.460
Man, you need to learn 
how to take a joke.

00:09:03.460 --> 00:09:05.060
Was that a lovers' quarrel?

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:08.020
Or was it a make out session?

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:09.580
What morons.

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:12.320
They don't even know that 
we're watching them.

00:09:14.160 --> 00:09:16.060
Well, we're just observing them

00:09:16.060 --> 00:09:18.680
and are holding back 
any sabotaging actions.

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:24.200
I can't figure out if they are 
simply pretending not to notice us

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:26.870
or if they really have not noticed us.

00:09:27.220 --> 00:09:29.250
If they are merely pretending 
not to notice us,

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:31.880
that last exchange becomes 
even more absurd.

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:35.080
If they are really not 
aware of us though,

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:37.920
the fact that we lost 
against them even once

00:09:37.920 --> 00:09:39.890
becomes even more annoying.

00:09:40.650 --> 00:09:42.550
Do they really not know we're here,

00:09:42.550 --> 00:09:45.090
but are still pretending that 
they noticed something?

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:48.510
Or do they know we are here and 
are wondering if they should

00:09:48.510 --> 00:09:51.090
pretend that they know something, or 
pretend that they don't know anything?

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:54.110
Ultimately...

00:09:55.710 --> 00:09:56.900
Which one is it?

00:09:56.900 --> 00:09:57.860
Erec-sama?!

00:09:58.140 --> 00:10:00.780
Erec-sama, get a hold of yourself!

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:04.970
You won't get an answer 
by agonizing about it.

00:10:04.970 --> 00:10:06.570
The only thing we can do is...

00:10:06.570 --> 00:10:07.540
...stop the wedding!

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:10.280
Why are you stealing my lines?

00:10:10.560 --> 00:10:12.480
I thought you were setting 
up for me to say that.

00:10:12.480 --> 00:10:14.620
I was just building it up!

00:10:14.620 --> 00:10:16.370
It is as Erec-sama says.

00:10:17.370 --> 00:10:20.640
Their movements are strange 
and warrant suspicion.

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:25.750
Shall we remember how we tried 
to sabotage the first ritual?

00:10:36.060 --> 00:10:39.040
We just need to get 
get him off that log.

00:10:39.040 --> 00:10:40.540
Shall we shoot him with arrows?

00:10:40.540 --> 00:10:42.350
We can't leave any evidence.

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:43.960
Then how are we going to do it?

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:45.620
With seduction.

00:10:45.850 --> 00:10:46.620
What?!

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:51.130
You guys think of me as some 
kind of funny erotic expert,

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:53.040
but that's not all that I am!

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:54.420
I am an erotic artisan.

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:55.800
I am an erotic priest.

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:57.210
I am an erotic performer.

00:10:57.210 --> 00:10:58.810
I am an erotic specialist.

00:10:59.530 --> 00:11:03.730
I don't care if you're an erotic, 
neurotic, or moronic specialist.

00:11:03.730 --> 00:11:04.850
Just get to the point.

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:06.440
Full nudity!

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:09.410
It's in our interest not
to leave a trace.

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:11.260
So what shall we do?

00:11:11.260 --> 00:11:13.680
The erotic specialist 
has come up with a plan.

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:15.850
When you're going down a dangerous 
river on the back of a log,

00:11:15.850 --> 00:11:18.010
you need concentration 
more than anything else.

00:11:18.010 --> 00:11:19.800
Split-second decisions.

00:11:19.800 --> 00:11:21.900
Take all of that away and 
you've got the solution!

00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:24.170
And the ultimate weapon for 
that task is full nudity!

00:11:24.170 --> 00:11:25.700
Nudist beach!

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:28.250
I've seen that in traffic lingo!

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:31.340
"Pretty women ahead. 
Keep your eyes from straying."

00:11:31.340 --> 00:11:33.250
That means pretty women cause accidents!

00:11:33.390 --> 00:11:37.090
Unfortunately we're men, 
but because we're a group,

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:41.310
he'll assume that a group of naked 
men belongs to a nudist group.

00:11:41.310 --> 00:11:43.070
That means fully nude women 
should be around, too.

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:45.350
That's how we'll stoke his expectations.

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:48.580
I see, if that's the plan, I'll do it!

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:51.640
I'm ready to go!

00:11:52.200 --> 00:11:54.030
Don't steal the show from me!

00:11:54.410 --> 00:11:57.140
I'm sorry, the timing was just right.

00:12:11.920 --> 00:12:12.620
Here he comes!

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:17.130
Big! Cut! Nice calves!

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:21.590
Ready? He's coming!

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:34.240
Gustave!

00:12:34.240 --> 00:12:37.060
No, it wasn't my suggestion!

00:12:37.060 --> 00:12:38.890
It was him!

00:12:39.290 --> 00:12:42.010
That Hyperion is exhausted.

00:12:42.010 --> 00:12:44.070
He should be at his spiritual limit.

00:12:44.370 --> 00:12:46.910
His mind is sluggish 
and dim when suddenly

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:50.410
something appears that can't 
possibly be from this world.

00:12:50.710 --> 00:12:54.920
His spirit will be beaten into an 
abyss of confusion and self-destruct.

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:01.710
Self-destruct...

00:13:04.310 --> 00:13:07.170
So, why don't you tell us already?

00:13:07.170 --> 00:13:11.530
No, wait, I'm honestly not 
interested in those things.

00:13:11.530 --> 00:13:16.810
Wait, so does that mean that 
you prefer boys over girls?

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:20.330
No, no, no. That's not what I meant.

00:13:20.330 --> 00:13:22.120
Suspicious...

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:25.150
So what about you, KT?

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:30.580
You're asking me? Now? 
If you're asking, I'll tell.

00:13:31.220 --> 00:13:34.660
But before that, Variation, 
how about you?

00:13:35.010 --> 00:13:37.400
I think I like kind girls.

00:13:39.120 --> 00:13:40.850
That's normal.

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:42.460
Me, me, me?

00:13:42.890 --> 00:13:45.170
Nobody asked you.

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:49.220
Ask me! Ask me! Ask me!

00:13:57.260 --> 00:13:59.670
I'm sure, Erec-sama's ready to do it!

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:02.140
That concentration, 
it's nothing to trifle with!

00:14:02.140 --> 00:14:05.940
Well, all our sabotage attempts 
failed completely so far.

00:14:06.420 --> 00:14:08.200
What was that idiotic nudist idea?

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:10.350
And who was the one 
who got seduced by the

00:14:10.350 --> 00:14:12.810
campfire and started a 
round of "who do you like"?

00:14:24.430 --> 00:14:25.270
No!

00:14:26.090 --> 00:14:27.300
No! No!

00:14:30.630 --> 00:14:32.050
What?

00:14:32.050 --> 00:14:34.620
Erec-sama went directly for a duel!

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:37.840
They do call Erec-sama 
the Golden Lion of Ulga!

00:14:37.840 --> 00:14:39.400
No, that's not it!

00:14:39.750 --> 00:14:41.680
Erec-sama couldn't let it slide!

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:44.570
His perfectionism didn't allow him to!

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:49.160
The line is crooked! 
Why can't you see that?!

00:14:49.910 --> 00:14:51.390
The thickness is irregular, too!

00:14:51.760 --> 00:14:54.580
Don't you know that the 
gods lives in the details?!

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:55.220
Give it here!

00:14:56.710 --> 00:14:57.910
And watch!

00:15:03.890 --> 00:15:04.920
You...

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:05.960
Erec-sama!

00:15:07.530 --> 00:15:08.530
You're

00:15:09.360 --> 00:15:10.930
amazing!

00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:12.300
What?!

00:15:12.900 --> 00:15:15.330
I didn't know anymore

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:18.310
if I could simply be here and do this.

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:21.510
I was just doing what I was told, 
the way I was told to do it,

00:15:21.510 --> 00:15:24.150
running on rails that 
others had laid for me.

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:27.110
I was wondering if you could 
even call that being alive.

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:30.490
But meeting you made me realize

00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:33.340
there are no rails.

00:15:33.340 --> 00:15:36.330
The heart that thinks that 
there are rails is the rails.

00:15:36.520 --> 00:15:38.370
What's with this pointless epiphany?

00:15:39.100 --> 00:15:40.830
Why are you moved by this?!

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:50.620
We'll meet again. 
We'll have our rematch then.

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:51.470
Yeah.

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:04.820
What are you doing?!

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:09.900
That's what happened,

00:16:10.130 --> 00:16:13.530
so the enemy has already smoothly 
progressed to the fifth ritual.

00:16:14.380 --> 00:16:17.960
According to Roxana from 
"Maidream" in the 5th district,

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:20.210
the fifth ritual is domino toppling.

00:16:20.210 --> 00:16:22.790
It looks like that's the 
end of the line for them.

00:16:23.060 --> 00:16:25.550
They will certainly not 
move on to the sixth ritual.

00:16:26.260 --> 00:16:29.550
Why? Because they will not 
succeed with this ritual.

00:16:29.770 --> 00:16:31.440
Erec-sama, are you going to

00:16:31.440 --> 00:16:33.940
use your Alma energy 
to cause an earthquake

00:16:33.940 --> 00:16:36.560
and mess up all the dominoes?

00:16:36.560 --> 00:16:37.890
I won't do anything like that!

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:40.800
We'll buy up all the dominoes!

00:16:46.460 --> 00:16:48.760
What? The hell is with that attitude?!

00:16:48.760 --> 00:16:51.340
I'm sorry. I simply can't sell them.

00:16:51.340 --> 00:16:53.990
You said it was 450 before!

00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:58.620
Why is it suddenly 620?! 
We just went to get money!

00:16:58.940 --> 00:17:02.120
I'm sorry, but this is a free economy.

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:04.120
Who asked you for your wisdom?!

00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:06.980
Enough, let's go to another store.

00:17:08.700 --> 00:17:10.590
What?! One thousand?!

00:17:11.950 --> 00:17:14.620
If you have no intention of 
selling them, just say so!

00:17:14.620 --> 00:17:18.220
No, the price is such precisely 
because there are buyers.

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:19.470
Seriously?!

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:20.470
Totally serious!

00:17:20.890 --> 00:17:24.410
It'll go higher even as 
we speak. Now it's 1200.

00:17:24.410 --> 00:17:25.390
1200?!

00:17:28.970 --> 00:17:32.570
I mean, it is Lord Jugglaburk's wedding.

00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:35.780
They're saying money is no object.

00:17:36.130 --> 00:17:38.060
They're so dirty.

00:17:38.060 --> 00:17:40.370
Well, we also tried to buy them up.

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:44.000
What kind of funds do we have right now?

00:17:45.070 --> 00:17:48.110
What I have right now is this.

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:54.650
Hey, that's barely anything. 
What are you spending it on?

00:17:55.060 --> 00:17:57.700
Well, then how much do you have?

00:18:02.230 --> 00:18:06.030
W-W-Wait! I'll bring more 
right away! I swear!

00:18:06.030 --> 00:18:06.810
And how?!

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:09.190
There's adult alchemy, you know.

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:12.370
Yeah right, you embezzler!

00:18:12.740 --> 00:18:14.360
And this is what I have.

00:18:15.960 --> 00:18:16.880
That's it?!

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:19.980
The tutus for us five cut pretty deep...

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:22.620
That's why I said that the funds 
should be managed centrally!

00:18:22.820 --> 00:18:24.820
You're too fussy!

00:18:24.820 --> 00:18:26.600
Just because you think you can

00:18:26.600 --> 00:18:28.080
file everything under "secret funding"!

00:18:28.300 --> 00:18:30.610
If you were to manage our finances,

00:18:30.610 --> 00:18:33.670
you'd never approve money 
to buy new weapons.

00:18:34.270 --> 00:18:37.170
There is no need to replace 
them when they're still usable.

00:18:37.430 --> 00:18:40.630
That sort of attitude keeps morale low!

00:18:41.360 --> 00:18:44.930
Well, couldn't we get 
somewhere if us four

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:46.720
pool our money with Erec-sama's?

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:54.360
Say what?!

00:18:54.920 --> 00:18:55.770
I'm sorry.

00:18:56.520 --> 00:18:58.650
Poverty is the root of all evil.

00:19:00.050 --> 00:19:03.660
Thinking about it, the sorority 
hasn't been sending us much lately.

00:19:04.050 --> 00:19:06.780
Sheesh, they're so tight-fisted.

00:19:06.780 --> 00:19:10.290
If I were the arch bishop, 
I would have cut us off right away.

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:12.170
Whose side are you on?

00:19:12.570 --> 00:19:15.530
Financially, Jugglaburk 
has the upper hand.

00:19:15.530 --> 00:19:18.010
At this rate they're really 
going to get married.

00:19:18.740 --> 00:19:21.180
I would have never expected dominoes 
to go up in price this much.

00:19:21.740 --> 00:19:24.300
There must be some insider 
trading going on.

00:19:24.480 --> 00:19:27.300
So that means the price of dominoes

00:19:27.300 --> 00:19:29.500
doesn't even concern Jugglaburk.

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:33.690
<i>And even Jugglaburk 
is getting married!</i>

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:36.640
<i>Even Jugglaburk! 
Despite being Jugglaburk!</i>

00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:38.110
<i>How dare he!</i>

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:42.570
<i>And what am I doing?! 
I can't even stop them!</i>

00:19:42.570 --> 00:19:44.550
<i>I've only lost.</i>

00:19:44.550 --> 00:19:48.330
<i>My balls and my chance 
at getting married!</i>

00:19:50.650 --> 00:19:53.070
Gentlemen, you're looking for dominoes?

00:19:53.070 --> 00:19:54.340
Who are you?

00:19:56.060 --> 00:19:58.710
I'm a black market dealer for dominoes.

00:19:58.710 --> 00:20:01.430
I've got good dominoes.

00:20:02.840 --> 00:20:06.350
I want to say something, 
but I think I'll lose if I do.

00:20:06.820 --> 00:20:09.430
So what kind of dominoes do you have?

00:20:11.210 --> 00:20:13.560
I'll have to see some coin first.

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:16.000
Wait, he could be a con man.

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:18.940
N-N-No! I'm not lying.

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:22.790
The dominoes I have are 
proper, real dominoes!

00:20:22.790 --> 00:20:24.070
Top quality.

00:20:24.390 --> 00:20:28.230
Then sell them at a proper 
price! 50 is fine, right?!

00:20:28.230 --> 00:20:32.700
I can't do that. 
My livelihood depends on this.

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:35.670
If you have dominoes, 
we'll buy them at your price!

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:46.120
This world has a free economy.

00:20:46.600 --> 00:20:49.060
We'll take that man's dominoes.

00:20:49.330 --> 00:20:52.390
I have a firm stance against 
unnatural price hikes!

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:53.890
Stay out of this!

00:20:53.890 --> 00:20:55.190
You stay out.

00:20:56.460 --> 00:20:59.650
Mister, the dominoes are mine, right?

00:21:00.740 --> 00:21:03.540
Sir, I won't allow any crooked business!

00:21:03.540 --> 00:21:07.200
Hey, let go or you won't 
get away unscathed.

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:10.680
No, you let go. 
Then we'll let you leave.

00:21:13.860 --> 00:21:15.250
Hey! Hey!

00:21:15.700 --> 00:21:18.790
You're hurting the innocent 
black market dealer.

00:21:20.640 --> 00:21:22.120
So what?

00:21:22.120 --> 00:21:24.060
I just want the dominoes.

00:21:24.790 --> 00:21:26.260
Then let's do it this way.

00:21:26.500 --> 00:21:28.960
The person who wants the dominoes,

00:21:28.960 --> 00:21:31.810
the one who thinks that they are 
the rightful owner of the dominoes,

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:35.250
should pull this black market 
dealer with all their might!

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:39.020
Ready? Go!

00:22:05.280 --> 00:22:07.240
That was scary.

00:22:07.240 --> 00:22:09.470
You made me throw up some red wine.

00:22:09.470 --> 00:22:13.200
Yeah, I thought you had been 
torn in half for a second.

00:22:13.200 --> 00:22:14.980
So what's our Erec-sama...

00:22:15.210 --> 00:22:17.980
And your woman doing?

00:22:18.310 --> 00:22:19.540
Dunno.

00:22:22.460 --> 00:22:25.940
<i>Could it be? This man has no...</i>

00:22:25.940 --> 00:22:29.920
<i>Could it be? This woman has...</i>

00:22:30.920 --> 00:22:32.870
Little did those two know

00:22:32.870 --> 00:22:36.180
that this small incident 
would have a large influence

00:22:36.180 --> 00:22:39.780
on the events yet to come.

00:24:10.090 --> 00:24:24.940
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:12.630
Day after day of marriage rituals are

00:24:12.630 --> 00:24:14.750
making the princess more and more irate.

00:24:14.750 --> 00:24:17.470
At this rate, that cowlick
 of hers will be back.

00:24:17.470 --> 00:24:19.680
We have to improve her mood somehow!

00:24:20.010 --> 00:24:23.190
Wait, this is a karaoke box?!

00:24:24.940 --> 00:24:29.830
The karaoke contest from 
hell has finally begun!

00:24:24.940 --> 00:24:29.830
Will there be any 
survivors left after?

00:24:29.830 --> 00:24:34.970
And in the room next door, 
Incognito is having

00:24:29.830 --> 00:24:34.970
a "cheer up Erec-sama" party.
